SDK with their OpenAI-compatible base URLs; SDK retries disabled (`maxRetries: 0`); each sends only the matrix's valid 
parameters for the chosen model and reasoning level; output requested and validated against one draft schema (summary 
sections, ≤100 items with description and assignee name as written); malformed/truncated output is a failure; an 
input-size preflight against the model's context/output budget refuses oversize transcripts before any request; 
provider errors are mapped to sanitized messages (no key, no transcript) and classified as pre-processing rejection 
only per the matrix. A server-only base-URL override selects the fake server; it is ignored and logged as refused when 
`NODE_ENV=production`, and no client input can set it.
