matching; request contains no roster), AC-016 (each failure outcome's counting), AC-025 (stale notice refused; 
admitted operation completes on P), AC-026 (oversize refused, usage unchanged), AC-027, AC-028 (concurrent starts 
dispatch once; replay received once), AC-029 (connection drop counted once; listed rejections not counted; 
